# L §5.6: "A bind over a kind states on d ... or over s"; `on` on a bind over an index has no meaning: LOAD-DOMAIN
# at load (L §8.4).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index ks = [a, b]
input d0: date
def c: int = count(k in ks on d0) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  d0 = 2026-01-01

ask q: c law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-DOMAIN ...
